        "procedure": "Nd2 (66 mg, 36 μmol) and Tb2 (69 mg, 36 μmol) were dissolved in 25 mL DCM in a dry Schlenk flask. The flask was evacuated and filled with N2 three times. Demineralized water (0.015 mL, 2 equiv.) and triethylamine (0.02 mL, 4 equiv.) were added. The solution changed from warm yellow to pale yellow-green. The solvent was removed in vacuo and the light yellow solid was recrystallized from warm toluene to give pale yellow crystals. ESI-MS showed MH+ for C74H42F24N6O16Nd2Tb2. Bulk ICP Nd:Tb was 0.29:0.71. CCDC 2453085 is not assigned here because its deposited formula is homometallic Nd4.",
